  "finding": "Returning starters associate with more wins_Y (OL r=0.2243, DL r=0.1733, OL+DL r=0.2722) but year-over-year change in wins is a null (OL r=-0.0198, DL r=-0.0183, OL+DL r=-0.0258). Intact lines (OL>=4 and DL>=3) average 10.28 wins vs 8.01 for everyone else, but mean d_wins is 0.17 vs 0.03. The level effect is selection (good teams keep their lines); continuity does not predict improvement."
